# Level 1 — the route (docs/drahtseilakt/autopilot-rules.md): sectors, stretches in order, the ball, the action.
# From the walkthrough's storyboard (ref/video/frames/fast/level01); the plan and hints made from it are
# Level_01.plan and Level_01.txt.

sector 1 wood
  start → the track west, the rails down                               pass, cruise
  the platform with the boxes P_Box_01..03, P_Extra_Life_04           pass (a box only while in the way)
  → P_Trafo_Stone_02                                                  pass into it → stone
  → P_Trafo_Wood_05 (a stone ball cannot climb the slope after it)    pass into it → wood
  the ramp north, east along z -364, the rails → PC_TwoFlames_01      pass, cruise

sector 2 wood
  the track east and the drops south → P_Trafo_Stone_01               pass into it → stone
  round west on the upper floor, off its edge at z -562.5             pass
  the crate of P_Modul_34_01 under the sliding stone                  ram east and on south-east (it must leave the
                                                                      stone free: the stone drops level with the lane)
  north along the lower floor's east side, the wedge ramp x 157       press up it
  the lane south over the long hump (P_Box_06 on top), P_Extra_Life_01 press at a steady push (a stone ball slowed on
                                                                      it rolls back) → PC_TwoFlames_02

sector 3 stone
  the step down south off the checkpoint, the slope                   pass, no halt at the edge
  east past the loose stone balls, north, east, down to the floor     pass
  north of the pushers P_Modul_01_01/02
  west, the side lane x 237 up and down onto the lower lane z -817     pass
  over the hump north into each pusher's plate (x 263, then 272)      press: the pusher slides out of the lane
  back, the side lane up, east along the lane z -793                  pass
  the rails x 299.6 south → P_Trafo_Wood_01                           press into it → wood
  → PC_TwoFlames_03                                                   pass

sector 4 wood
  the track east, the zigzag climb to y 76, the descent east          pass, cruise
  → PE_Balloon_01                                                     pass
